          {
            "title": "Question 5",
            "id": 71198,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa servono gli attributi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"> Aggiungono informazioni aggiuntive ai tag</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Gli attributi creano collegamenti</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Creano tag vuoti</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Gli attributi creano URL</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"> Aggiungono informazioni aggiuntive ai tag.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una pagina contiene <code>&lt;a href=\"https://mimo.org\"&gt;Mimo&lt;/a&gt;</code>. Che cosa fa <code>href</code> per il tag <code>a</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiunge al tag l'indirizzo del link</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Cambia il nome del tag in <code>href</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Crea il testo mostrato sulla pagina</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Chiude il tag <code>a</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiunge al tag l'indirizzo del link.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 6",
            "id": 71197,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come appare il link nel browser?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Another Famous Page\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elliot_Page&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Elliot Page\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Elliot Page</code> come link con enfasi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Elliot Page</code> come link normale</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Elliot Page</code> in corsivo, ma con un link non funzionante</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;em&gt;Elliot Page&lt;/em&gt;</code> come link</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Elliot Page</code> come link con enfasi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rimuovi <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>, ma mantieni il testo. Come appare <code>Elliot Page</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Another Famous Page\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elliot_Page&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Elliot Page\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>Elliot Page</code> come link con enfasi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Elliot Page</code> solo come testo con enfasi, senza link</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"true\"><code>Elliot Page</code> come link, ma senza enfasi</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;em&gt;Elliot Page&lt;/em&gt;</code> come testo visibile del link</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Elliot Page</code> come link, ma senza enfasi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 7",
            "id": 71200,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://m.xkcd.com/1425/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il nome dell'attributo dovrebbe essere <code>href</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non contiene testo tra <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è niente di sbagliato nel codice</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Manca il tag di apertura <code>&lt;a&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il nome dell'attributo dovrebbe essere <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Questo codice deve far sì che il testo apra una pagina web. Quale parte deve cambiare?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://m.xkcd.com/1425/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il nome dell'attributo dovrebbe essere <code>href</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'URL deve trovarsi tra <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il testo deve essere rimosso perché i link non possono avere testo</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Il tag di chiusura deve essere <code>&lt;/src&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il nome dell'attributo dovrebbe essere <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 71159,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice per farlo funzionare correttamente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/r/lisa.html&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Click to visit my website!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"69\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 71160,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi l'attributo corretto al tag di apertura <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome to the Roaring Twenties, rebooted!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://www.1920-30.com/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Take a look at the previous\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   Roaring Twenties here! \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 7",
            "id": 71600,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il problema con questo elemento <code>img</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/snapcat.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il tag dovrebbe avere <code>img</code> come nome del tag, non il tag <code>a</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Niente</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">All'elemento <code>img</code> manca un tag di chiusura</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Manca un URL per accedere all'immagine</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il tag dovrebbe avere <code>img</code> come nome del tag, non il tag <code>a</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vuoi che questo codice mostri un’immagine nella pagina. Cosa devi cambiare?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/snapcat.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il tag dovrebbe avere <code>img</code> come nome del tag, non il tag <code>a</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'attributo <code>src</code> deve essere sostituito con <code>href</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">L'indirizzo del file immagine deve trovarsi tra i tag di apertura e di chiusura</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">L'elemento deve avere il testo del link dopo l'URL</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il tag dovrebbe avere <code>img</code> come nome del tag, non il tag <code>a</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 59597,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta l'attributo <code>width</code> in questo tag immagine su <code>\"300\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/taxi.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>\"300\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 6",
            "id": 59600,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta l'attributo <code>height</code> di questo tag immagine su <code>\"200\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/cat.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"36\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>height=\"200\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 9",
            "id": 71541,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quanti elementi <code>img</code> contiene questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"A cat\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/kittles.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/cat.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My cat\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Uno</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Due</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tre</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Uno.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cambi la destinazione del link in un altro file immagine. Quante immagini mostra questo codice nella pagina?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"A cat\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/kittles.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/cat.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My cat\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Uno</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Due, perché il link punta a un file immagine</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tre, perché <code>br</code> crea un elemento visibile</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Uno.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 71540,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta gli attributi <code>height</code> e <code>width</code> in modo che l'altezza sia maggiore della larghezza.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/clawdius.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;220&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"src\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"href\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"300\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"220\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il tag immagine in modo che usi <code>/img/clawdius.png</code> e che l'immagine sia più alta che larga.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/clawdius.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;220&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"href\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"img\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"source\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>src</code>, seguito da <code>\"300\"</code> e infine <code>\"220\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
